'''Artisan's Sanctum''' (美術工房アートリエ ''Bijutsu Kōbō Ātorie'', '''Fine Art Studio Artelier''') is the 30th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 128th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Very easy sub-chapter with little to no difficulty aside from [[Sluggish Sketching]], which has [[Surge Attack|Surge]] spam. Most of the stages resemble Uncanny Legends stages (especially [[Crested Colors]]), making gameplay very mundane.

